{#- CR-004 — the Proforma layout of a Sales Order. The live site also made this
    record the doctype's DEFAULT (Property Setter, 2026-09-24), so it is what the
    printer icon renders. Row 12 (2026-10-08): with Print As = Delivery Note the
    document is a delivery note whatever format the icon picked — route to the
    shared Sales Order template, which renders the delivery columns. Behind
    `oct08_r12_so_delivery_note`: without the switch this renders byte-for-byte
    what it rendered before. -#}
{%- set katc_as_delivery = (doc.doctype == "Sales Order" and yht_feature("oct08_r12_so_delivery_note") and (doc.get("custom_print_as") or "") == "Delivery Note") -%}
{% if katc_as_delivery %}{% include "yht_custom/templates/includes/katc/sales_order.html" %}{% else %}{% include "yht_custom/templates/includes/katc/proforma_invoice.html" %}{% endif %}
